WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.291 --> 00:00:15.259
dragon ate my horse!"

2
00:00:15.699 --> 00:00:16.300
said the monk.

3
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.001
He fell to his knees.

4
00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:21.183
"How will I ever get to the Western Paradise?

5
00:00:22.104 --> 00:00:23.966
There are so many dangers along the way!"

6
00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:25.887
Wukong laughed.

7
00:00:25.907 --> 00:00:28.850
"Master, you worry too much.

8
00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:31.452
There will be many dangers on your journey.

9
00:00:33.004 --> 00:00:35.566
But you have me, the Monkey King, to protect you.

10
00:00:37.107 --> 00:00:38.608
of Heaven's soldiers couldn't defeat me.

11
00:00:39.148 --> 00:00:40.649
So why worry about a dragon?"

12
00:00:47.854 --> 00:00:51.377
The monkey stepped into the water and pulled out his iron bar.

13
00:00:53.578 --> 00:00:55.139
"I'll get the dragon to come out of the water."

14
00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:57.761
looked down at the water.

15
00:00:57.781 --> 00:01:03.504
"Dragon! Get up here right now!"

16
00:01:03.584 --> 00:01:05.145
The dragon leaped from the water.

17
00:01:07.127 --> 00:01:08.929
dare you yell at me!

18
00:01:09.729 --> 00:01:11.171
Who are you?"

19
00:01:13.172 --> 00:01:14.473
doesn't matter who I am!"

20
00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:15.734
shouted Wukong.

21
00:01:15.754 --> 00:01:17.576
"Give that horse back!"

22
00:01:19.217 --> 00:01:24.682
The monkey attacked the dragon with his iron bar.

23
00:01:25.122 --> 00:01:28.025
The dragon spun around, blocking the bar with his tail.

24
00:01:28.766 --> 00:01:31.308
Then with a splash, he dived back underwater.

25
00:01:32.448 --> 00:01:34.889
Wukong stomped his foot and yelled at the river.

26
00:01:34.909 --> 00:01:40.231
"Coward!" will we do?"

27
00:01:40.631 --> 00:01:41.512
asked the Tang Monk.

28
00:01:41.532 --> 00:01:43.092
"I have no horse."

29
00:01:45.193 --> 00:01:46.034
Wukong nodded.

30
00:01:46.054 --> 00:01:49.255
"And we can't cross the river with that dragon in there.

31
00:01:50.195 --> 00:01:51.196
I'll try another plan."

32
00:01:53.477 --> 00:01:55.778
monkey swirled the water with his iron bar.

33
00:01:56.838 --> 00:01:57.999
The water became rough.

34
00:01:58.739 --> 00:02:00.680
Waves crashed and churned.

35
00:02:01.876 --> 00:02:04.478
The water dragged up dirt from the river bottom.

36
00:02:05.379 --> 00:02:07.340
Soon the river was brown and muddy.

37
00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:10.222
The dragon appeared again.

38
00:02:12.604 --> 00:02:14.326
on earth are you doing now?"

39
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:15.246
he cried.

40
00:02:15.266 --> 00:02:18.108
"I'm trying to take a nap!"

41
00:02:19.429 --> 00:02:20.670
"Give us back our horse!"

42
00:02:21.051 --> 00:02:22.091
demanded Wukong.

43
00:02:23.593 --> 00:02:25.214
can't!" cried the dragon.

44
00:02:25.234 --> 00:02:29.252
"It's in my stomach!"

45
00:02:29.532 --> 00:02:31.313
The monkey attacked the dragon again.

46
00:02:34.075 --> 00:02:36.957
But once more the dragon disappeared under the water.

47
00:02:39.438 --> 00:02:42.680
For more than three hours, Wukong yelled at the river.

48
00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.221
yelled all kinds of insults.

49
00:02:46.002 --> 00:02:50.104
But the dragon would not come back up.

50
00:02:50.184 --> 00:02:56.988
Wukong climbed up the riverbank and sat down next to the Tang Monk.

51
00:02:58.464 --> 00:02:59.605
"That dragon is tough.

52
00:03:00.965 --> 00:03:03.066
not afraid of him, but I can't beat him either.

53
00:03:03.506 --> 00:03:04.026
I need help."

54
00:03:05.767 --> 00:03:06.507
"Who can help you?"

55
00:03:06.848 --> 00:03:07.788
asked the Tang Monk.

56
00:03:08.788 --> 00:03:10.289
Wukong thought for a moment.

57
00:03:11.490 --> 00:03:13.830
"Guanyin told me I can ask her for help if I need it."

58
00:03:16.031 --> 00:03:16.932
said the Tang Monk.

59
00:03:17.572 --> 00:03:18.693
"She told me the same thing."

60
00:03:19.793 --> 00:03:22.574
Wukong felt the headband and shot a look at the monk.

61
00:03:23.735 --> 00:03:24.775
already did help you.

62
00:03:25.335 --> 00:03:28.732
She gave you this tight headband."

63
00:03:28.952 --> 00:03:31.533
sighed. "But that doesn't matter now.

64
00:03:33.934 --> 00:03:34.314
wait here.

65
00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:35.095
I'll be back soon."

66
00:03:36.275 --> 00:03:38.716
Wukong shot into the air and flew south.

67
00:03:42.378 --> 00:03:45.419
Soon he came to Mount Potalaka in the South Sea.

68
00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.960
was in a garden next to her pagoda.

69
00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:52.342
"Hello, Wukong," she said.

70
00:03:53.382 --> 00:03:54.463
is the journey going?

71
00:03:54.483 --> 00:03:58.940
I see you're wearing the headband."

72
00:03:59.020 --> 00:04:00.741
"Yes, thanks to your dirty tricks!"

73
00:04:01.101 --> 00:04:01.781
said the monkey.

74
00:04:02.821 --> 00:04:04.001
Guanyin smiled.

75
00:04:04.702 --> 00:04:06.762
"You need that headband, Wukong.

76
00:04:07.762 --> 00:04:09.843
You are too violent and cruel."

77
00:04:11.624 --> 00:04:12.584
rolled his eyes.

78
00:04:12.604 --> 00:04:16.365
"Fine. I'm here because I have a problem.

79
00:04:17.485 --> 00:04:19.286
reached a wide river with a dragon in it.

80
00:04:19.846 --> 00:04:22.967
The dragon ate our horse."

81
00:04:23.087 --> 00:04:26.448
"Did you tell the dragon that you're traveling with the Tang Monk?"

82
00:04:26.848 --> 00:04:28.688
asked Guanyin.

83
00:04:28.708 --> 00:04:29.949
"No," said the monkey.

84
00:04:29.969 --> 00:04:33.250
"Why?" Guanyin sighed.

85
00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:37.212
"That dragon was waiting for you.

86
00:04:38.632 --> 00:04:43.074
When I met him, he was being punished for setting fire to his father's palace.

87
00:04:44.475 --> 00:04:48.016
I told him to help the Tang Monk reach the Western Paradise.

88
00:04:49.017 --> 00:04:51.218
That way he can earn forgiveness."

89
00:04:52.818 --> 00:04:54.379
Wukong scratched his head.

90
00:04:55.639 --> 00:04:56.560
too late for that now.

91
00:04:57.294 --> 00:04:58.043
He won't come out of the
